# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ([''] tccompare: ['']), kab-tshiab.
